    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The transmutation rituals of the Bringers of the Cosmic Dawn have reshaped your body. Perhaps you were caught up in one of the organization's experiments by accident, or perhaps you were a member who sought to perfect your body through magic. Either way, you turn your strange anatomy to your advantage.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Dexterity, Constitution</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.RwzhXQ0pAqFtJH1p]{Transmuted Anatomy}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Athletics and Survival</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> <em>Choose one kind of</em> Artisan's Tools</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) Artisan's Tools (same as above), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBackpack000]{Backpack}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRobe0000000]{Robe}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 30 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
